@baseUrl = {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}/api
@parentToken = demo_parent_token
@studentToken = demo_student_token

### Learners of the parent account (Bạn, Bin, Su) + default + fees due this week
GET {{baseUrl}}/today/learners?api_token={{parentToken}}

### Today for the default learner
GET {{baseUrl}}/today?api_token={{parentToken}}

### Today for one learner (replace the id with one from /today/learners)
GET {{baseUrl}}/today?learnerId=1&api_token={{parentToken}}

### Student with no kids: only "Bạn"
GET {{baseUrl}}/today/learners?api_token={{studentToken}}

### Student today
GET {{baseUrl}}/today?api_token={{studentToken}}

### Another account's learner is rejected (expect resultCode 0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/today?learnerId=5&api_token={{parentToken}}

### Mark attendance ("Bé đã đi học") - only after the session started
POST {{baseUrl}}/today/attendance?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": 1, "sessionKey": "1_20261013" }

### Join online class - opens 15 minutes before start, returns the Zoom link
POST {{baseUrl}}/today/join?api_token={{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": 1, "sessionKey": "1_20261013" }

### Ask for leave / reschedule / makeup (type: leave | reschedule | makeup)
POST {{baseUrl}}/today/requests?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": 1, "sessionKey": "1_20261016", "type": "leave", "note": "Bé ốm" }

### Fee period guard: overlapping period is rejected, next period is accepted
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/add?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemId": 1, "studentId": 1, "startDate": "2026-12-01" }

### Plan 07: surveys waiting for this account (mid-course "Bé học có vui không?")
GET {{baseUrl}}/lifecycle/surveys?api_token={{parentToken}}

### Plan 07: answer a survey (score 1-5, note optional; low scores notify the back office)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lifecycle/feedback?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enrollmentId": 1, "score": 4, "note": "" }

### Plan 07: one-tap renewal (puts the same course, learner and class in the cart; then POST /checkout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lifecycle/renew?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enrollmentId": 1 }
